-## Subtopics
+**Pseudocode:**
+```python
+import math
+
+def compute_transmittance(ray_origin, ray_direction, boundary, sigma_s, sigma_a):
+    # Intersect ray with boundary to find entry and exit distances t_in, t_out
+    t_in, t_out = boundary.intersect(ray_origin, ray_direction)
+    if t_in is None or t_out is None:
+        return 1.0  # No intersection, full transmittance [G]
+    
+    t = t_out - t_in
+    sigma_t = sigma_s + sigma_a
+    return math.exp(-sigma_t * t)
+```
 
